            Start Your Exchange
          </a>
          <a href="/schedule" class="bg-blue-900 text-white px-6 py-2 rounded-md text-sm font-medium hover:bg-blue-800 transition-colors duration-200 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500 focus:ring-offset-2">
